# She runs the department in Russian: руководить, управлять + instrumental
subtitle: "Руководить отделом, увлекаться историей, любоваться картинами: Russian verbs that take the instrumental — as Masha gets her promotion."
tags: ["russian","russian instrumental","руководить","verb government","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/verb-cases","vocabulary/jobs"]
thumb: "band \"She runs the department, in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A presentation in Russian: Позвольте представить, в заключение","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/204-russian-presentation.cast"}

